# When this file exists, the EB CLI uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore to decide what
# to bundle. So .env.production and BUILD_VERSION (both git-ignored) still ship —
# that's intentional: prod secrets + the version stamp must be in the deploy zip.
# Everything listed here is EXCLUDED from the bundle.
.venv
venv
.env
.env.local
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
logs
_smoke_test.py
